%description:
Tests softIcmpErrorsAbortSetup with a Parameter Problem (12/0), a soft error
of RFC 9293 section 3.9.2.2, as Linux tcp_v4_err(): the tester answers the SYN
of the client with it, and the client aborts the connection in SYN_SENT.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.cli_tcp.softIcmpErrorsAbortSetup = true
*.tcptester.script="A1 icmp 12 0"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# answering with an ICMP error
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Hard ICMPv4 error during connection setup -- connection refused
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
